// The cloud model's address. Empty means there is no cloud model: the
// setting stays off and can't be turned on, and no network code runs.
// Leave it empty here. To try a real address, put it in
// Config/Cloud.local.xcconfig, which git ignores, so it is never committed:
//   PEBBLE_CLOUD_ENDPOINT = https:/$()/example.com
// It must be a plain https address: a user name, password, query (?) or
// fragment (#) is refused. xcconfig reads // as a comment, so write the
// slashes as https:/$()/ as above.
// Never put keys or tokens here or in the address. Sign-in goes through CloudAuth.
PEBBLE_CLOUD_ENDPOINT =

#include? "Cloud.local.xcconfig"
